        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9027/457, 18 Inch Long Cabinet Bar Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis long 18 Inch Cabinet Bar Pull is an eye-catcher for sure. Its modern style paired with beautiful and contemporary finishes make it stand out in the best way. This 18 Inch Cabinet Handle can be used on any light-weight drawer or door including barn doors, dressers, entertainment stands, and bathroom vanities. If you're looking for a quick way to update your furniture, just replace the current pulls with this lovely Omnia 9027/457 Handle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9027\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9027 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
